(text "8 parallel address ports: A0..A15 on pins 1..16, GND on pins 17..20\nEnable only one external source: PC, MAR or IDX\nU1/U2 drive only the LEDs, never the shared address bus\nJ9: +5V / GND; address ports do not carry power\nSW1 ON enables bit LEDs; OFF pulls OE_n high through 10k; PWR stays on" (at 140 178 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid d5b9dc11-8d86-4e6f-9d61-85d058d8bfe7))
